     A*****************************************************************
     A* WORKERS' COMP NOTIFICATIONS MASTER FILE                       *
     A*****************************************************************
     A*                                                               *
     A*  PROJECT:  WC2277       PROGRAMMER:  C:65                     *
     A*  CREATED:  04/10/14                                           *
     A*  DESCRIPTION:  THIS FILE HOLDS THE RECORDS FOR CONTROLLING    *
     A*                THE EMAILS/NOTIFICATIONS OF A POLICY.  THERE   *
     A*                WILL BE ONE RECORD PER TYPE OF NOTIFICATION    *
     A*                FOR EACH POLICY.  A CORRESPONDING DETAIL FILE, *
     A*                WDNDP, WILL CONTAIN ONE RECORD FOR EACH DOCU-  *
     A*                MENT THAT IS TO BE ATTACHED TO THE EMAIL.  IF  *
     A*                THE CASE FIELD IS POPULATED THEN THE NOTIFICA- *
     A*                TION WILL BE FOR A SPECIFIC CLAIM ON A POLICY. *
     A*                                                               *
     A*****************************************************************
     A* REVISIONS:                                                    *
     A*                                                               *
     A* 07/31/14 C:65  PROJECT: WC2277                                *
     A*                ADD FIELDS FOR EMAIL CC, SUBJECT, AND BODY TO  *
     A*                ALLOW EDITING TO BE DONE.                      *
     A*                                                               *
     A*****************************************************************
     A                                      REF(WREFP)
     A          R PNE01                     TEXT('NOTIFICATIONS FILE')
     A            NECO#     R     S         REFFLD(CO#)
     A            NEFND     R     S         REFFLD(FND)
     A            NEEMP#    R     S         REFFLD(EMP#)
     A            NEDIV     R     S         REFFLD(DIV)
     A            NEFYR     R     S         REFFLD(FYR)
     A            NECASE    R     S         REFFLD(CASE)
     A            NETYPE    R               REFFLD(DS20)
     A                                      COLHDG('TYPE OF NOTIFICATION')
     A            NESTAT    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('NOTIFICATION STATUS')
     A            NESTDT    R     S         REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('STATUS DATE')
     A            NEMAIL    R               REFFLD(DS00)
     A                                      COLHDG('EMAIL FOR' 'NOTIFICATION')
     A            NEUSRM    R               REFFLD(DS00)
     A                                      COLHDG('USER EMAIL FOR'-
     A                                             'NOTIFICATION')
     A            NEUSER    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('USER')
     A            NEPGM     R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A                                      COLHDG('PROGRAM')
     A            NETIME    R     S         REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('TIME')
     A            NEDT      R     S         REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('DATE')
     A            NEIUSR    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('INITIAL' 'USER')
     A            NEIPGM    R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A                                      COLHDG('INITIAL' 'PROGRAM')
     A            NEITIM    R     S         REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('INITIAL' 'TIME')
     A            NEIDT     R     S         REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('INITIAL' 'DATE')
     A            NECCEM      1000A         COLHDG('CC EMAIL ADDRESSES')
     A            NESUBJ       500A         COLHDG('EMAIL SUBJECT TEXT')
     A            NEBODY      2000A         COLHDG('EMAIL BODY TEXT')
